        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-03T17:22:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should be partitioning our PNGs in bazel based on if this is true or not instead of using code to do so. We can have code to an assertion if we try to use a non-greyscale image with kGrayscale_Always_DstColorType.",
